{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n163.jpg","n":"71"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/opening"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עַל הַכֹּל יִתְגַּדַּל וְיִתְקַדַּשׁ וְיִשְׁתַּבַּח וְיִתְפָּאַר וְיִתְרוֹמַם וְיִתְנַשֵּׂא: שְׁמוֹ שֶׁל־מֶלֶךְ מַלְכֵי הַמְּלָכִים הַקָּדוֹשׁ בָּרוּךְ הוּא: בָּעוֹלָמוֹת שֶׁבָּרָא הָעוֹלָם הַזֶּה וְהָעוֹלָם הַבָּא: כִּרְצוֹנוֹ וְכִרְצוֹן יְרֵאָיו וְכִרְצוֹן כָּל־בֵּית יִשְׂרָאֵל: צוּר "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n165.jpg","n":"72"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"הָעוֹלָמִים אֲדוֹן כָּל־הַבְּרִיּוֹת אֱלוֹהַּ כָּל־הַנְּפָשׁוֹת: הַיּוֹשֵׁב בְּמֶרְחֲבֵי מָרוֹם הַשּׁוֹכֵן בִּשְׁמֵי שְׁמֵי קֶדֶם: קְדֻשָּׁתוֹ עַל הַחַיּוֹת וּקְדֻשָּׁתוֹ עַל כִּסֵּא הַכָּבוֹד: וּבְכֵן יִתְקַדַּשׁ שִׁמְךָ בָּנוּ "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אֱלֹהֵינוּ לְעֵינֵי כָּל־חָי: וְנֹאמַר לְפָנָיו שִׁיר חָדָשׁ כַּכָּתוּב:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"68","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/shiru"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"5","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/shiru/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/68/5"}}
{"text":"שִׁירוּ לֵאלֹהִים זַמְּרוּ שְׁמוֹ סֹלּוּ לָרוֹכֵב בָּעֲרָבוֹת בְּיָהּ שְׁמוֹ וְעִלְזוּ לְפָנָיו:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  וְנִרְאֵהוּ עַיִן בְּעַיִן בְּשׁוּבוֹ אֶל נָוֵהוּ כַּכָּתוּב:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"52","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/ayin"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"8","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/ayin/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"half-verse","n":"b","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/ayin/8/b"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/52/8/b"}}
{"text":"כִּי עַיִן בְּעַיִן יִרְאוּ בְּשׁוּב "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" צִיּוֹן:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"half-verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"  וְנֶאֱמַר  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"40","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/veniglah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"5","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:al_hakol/quotations/veniglah/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/40/5"}}
{"text":"וְנִגְלָה כְּבוֹד "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" וְרָאוּ כָל־בָּשָׂר יַחְדָּו כִּי פִּי "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" דִּבֵּר:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
